@PotteryHut.Api_HostAddress = https://localhost:8000

### Hämta alla produkter
GET {{PotteryHut.Api_HostAddress}}/api/products
Accept: application/json

### Hämta produkt via slug
GET {{PotteryHut.Api_HostAddress}}/api/products?slug=mud-mugg
Accept: application/json

### Hämta produkt via id
GET {{PotteryHut.Api_HostAddress}}/api/products/23
Accept: application/json

### Skapa produkt
POST {{PotteryHut.Api_HostAddress}}/api/products
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Tropical Tallrik",
  "description": "Handgjord tallrik ur Tropical Collection, med en unik yta där ingen är den andra lik.",
  "price": 299,
  "image": "/products/tropical-plate.png"
}

### Radera produkt
DELETE {{PotteryHut.Api_HostAddress}}/api/products/35

### Hämta alla kategorier
GET {{PotteryHut.Api_HostAddress}}/api/categories
Accept: application/json

### Hämta kategori via id (1-6 produkttyper, 7-11 kollektioner)
GET {{PotteryHut.Api_HostAddress}}/api/categories/10
Accept: application/json

### Skapa kategori
POST {{PotteryHut.Api_HostAddress}}/api/categories
Content-Type: application/json

  {
    "name": "Tropical Collection"
  }

### Radera kategori
DELETE {{PotteryHut.Api_HostAddress}}/api/categories/13